{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026SnpKj6RsD01794989303.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案續審。第40日審訊，蔡天鳳前家翁、被告鄺球繼續作供。他承認負責肢解蔡天鳳，但強調絕對無預謀殺死她。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207025-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E9%84%BA%E7%90%83%E7%A8%B1%E5%85%A8%E6%AC%8A%E8%B2%A0%E8%B2%AC%E8%82%A2%E8%A7%A3%E6%83%9F%E7%B5%95%E7%84%A1%E9%A0%90%E8%AC%80%E6%AE%BA%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%9C%E4%BE%9B%E6%9C%9F%E9%96%93%E5%A4%9A%E6%AC%A1%E5%93%BD%E5%92%BD%E6%8A%B9%E7%9C%BC%E6%B7%9A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>蔡天鳳碎屍案｜鄺球稱全權負責肢解惟絕無預謀殺人　作供期間多次哽咽抹眼淚</strong></a></p><p></p><p>到深圳出席APEC會議的行政長官李家超，與多位領導人舉行雙邊會談。他又指，對國家主席習近平提出成立世界灣區經濟合作聯盟，感到振奮和鼓舞。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207024-APEC%E6%9D%8E%E5%AE%B6%E8%B6%85%E5%B0%8D%E7%BF%92%E8%BF%91%E5%B9%B3%E5%80%A1%E8%A8%AD%E7%81%A3%E5%8D%80%E7%B6%93%E5%90%88%E8%81%AF%E7%9B%9F%E6%84%9F%E6%8C%AF%E5%A5%AE%E5%8F%AF%E8%88%87%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E7%B6%93%E6%BF%9F%E9%AB%94%E4%BA%92%E8%81%AF%E4%BA%92%E9%80%9A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>APEC｜李家超：對習近平倡設灣區經合聯盟感振奮　可與不同經濟體互聯互通</strong></a></p><p></p><p>中大醫院一名女病人被錯誤切除雙側卵巢，院方致歉，指涉事醫生為合約駐院醫生，發稿指他做手術時出現「認知盲點」，並非掩飾錯誤。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207035-%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%A7%E9%86%AB%E9%99%A2%E5%B0%B1%E5%A5%B3%E7%97%85%E4%BA%BA%E8%A2%AB%E9%8C%AF%E8%AA%A4%E5%88%87%E9%99%A4%E9%9B%99%E5%81%B4%E5%8D%B5%E5%B7%A2%E8%87%B4%E6%AD%89\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>中大醫院就女病人被錯誤切除雙側卵巢致歉</strong></a></p><p></p><p>本港過去八年共發生162宗致命工業意外。勞工及福利局局長孫玉菡在立法會大會回應議員質詢時表示，自推出吊棚工作呈報平台後，呈報個案持續上升。不過有議員質疑，機制屬自願呈報，未能覆蓋所有工程。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207034-%E6%9C%AC%E6%B8%AF%E9%81%8E%E5%8E%BB%E5%85%AB%E5%B9%B4%E9%8C%84162%E5%AE%97%E8%87%B4%E5%91%BD%E5%B7%A5%E6%A5%AD%E6%84%8F%E5%A4%96%E8%AD%B0%E5%93%A1%E8%B3%AA%E7%96%91%E5%90%8A%E6%A3%9A%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E5%91%88%E5%A0%B1%E6%A9%9F%E5%88%B6%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E7%9B%B2%E9%BB%9E\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>本港過去八年錄162宗致命工業意外　議員質疑吊棚工作呈報機制存在盲點</strong></a></p><p></p><p>皇崗口岸開通一個月，每日平均有8.8萬人次出入境。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207033-%E7%9A%87%E5%B4%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%B2%B8%E9%96%8B%E9%80%9A%E4%B8%80%E5%80%8B%E6%9C%88%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E5%B9%B3%E5%9D%8788%E8%90%AC%E4%BA%BA%E6%AC%A1%E5%87%BA%E5%85%A5%E5%A2%83\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>皇崗口岸開通一個月　每日平均8.8萬人次出入境</strong></a></p><p></p><p></p><p>(旁述由AI生成)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T09:04:14.575493+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":484,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T08:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T20:17:40.022848+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T08:57:19.312956+00:00","content_hash":"c45189e7bb6e57939b44149367e250902c4715712722b65cc30c5a7ba396b812","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T09:04:14.575493+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}